{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39837996",
      "title": "Validating Input via Built-in Validation Props",
      "sourceHash": "adff2dc320480a361cc06d9c28c3a0593fe4533323a20226cddbbf0117f0dd8a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.84,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "So you can validate inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 7.05,
          "en": "upon form submission by adding your own code like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.05,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "but you can make your life even easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "And for that I'll switch back to the signup component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 17.55,
          "en": "where we have this more complex form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 20.76,
          "en": "And of course here we could also listen to keystrokes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.76,
          "end": 23.73,
          "en": "and focus and do all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.73,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "But we of course would have to write a lot of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 28.62,
          "en": "and we could also handle the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.62,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "upon submission as we're doing it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 32.883,
          "en": "in this login form in the last lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36.813,
          "en": "But we can also make our life even easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.77,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "For that, I'll first start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 42.9,
          "en": "by importing this signup component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.9,
          "end": 47.133,
          "en": "from Components signup JSX here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.32,
          "end": 52.263,
          "en": "And then I'll use it here in the JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 57.39,
          "en": "And now to validate all these inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.39,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "when the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "we can take an even easier route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "and not write any custom code at all for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "and instead use some built-in attributes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.84,
          "end": 74.84,
          "en": "some built-in Props provided by the browser, not by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.39,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "but by the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "which you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 81.93,
          "en": "to those input HTML elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.93,
          "end": 84.483,
          "en": "For example, the required Prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "And the required Prop is just one of multiple built-in Props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "and attributes, which you can set on input elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 98.00999999999999,
          "en": "to let the browser validate the user's input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.00999999999999,
          "end": 101.49000000000001,
          "en": "You can learn more about this if you, for example, search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.49000000000001,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "for HTML form validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "because you'll then find an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "on MDN where you can learn more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "about form validation and where you can also learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 115.56,
          "en": "about these built-in attributes and Props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.56,
          "end": 118.86,
          "en": "which you can add to your form control elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.86,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "to control which kind of validation will be performed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 123.063,
          "en": "by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 127.08,
          "en": "For example, if you add required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.08,
          "end": 130.32,
          "en": "the browser will not allow this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.32,
          "end": 132.723,
          "en": "to be empty if it's submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "In addition, it will then also take the type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 139.65,
          "en": "of the input field into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 142.98,
          "en": "And for example here, when the type is email,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.98,
          "end": 147.213,
          "en": "not allow values that are not email addresses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 152.64,
          "en": "So if I save this with a required add to this email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.64,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "and I reload this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.68,
          "en": "if I try to sign up like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.68,
          "end": 162.09300000000002,
          "en": "I get this error message that this must be filled out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "If I do enter some value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 168.03,
          "en": "which is now not a valid email address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.03,
          "end": 170.94,
          "en": "I also get an error also provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 174.63,
          "en": "by the browser, not by me, not by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.63,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "where it also tells me that this is an invalid email address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 181.023,
          "en": "that I should add and @ here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 185.673,
          "en": "And if I do that, now I can submit this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "And that's of course, therefore an even easier way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 194.61,
          "en": "of adding validation because we don't have to write any code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.61,
          "end": 198.3,
          "en": "on our own, we just have to add these attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 201.513,
          "en": "And I can also add that here to the password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "And on the password field we could now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "of course also add the minLength Prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 212.4,
          "en": "to set this minLength validation attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.4,
          "end": 215.91,
          "en": "which just like required is a built-in one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.91,
          "end": 220.14,
          "en": "And this allows us to define a minimum expected length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.14,
          "end": 222.57,
          "en": "of the entered value, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.57,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "to make sure that the entered password must be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 227.583,
          "en": "at least six characters long.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 233.97,
          "en": "And of course we can add that to all these inputs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "And also add required here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "and also add that to a select.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 242.97,
          "en": "You are not restricted to just input elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.97,
          "end": 247.29,
          "en": "Instead, all form control elements, including selects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.29,
          "end": 250.593,
          "en": "support these special Props and attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.47,
          "end": 255.42,
          "en": "So we can do this here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.42,
          "end": 257.34,
          "en": "I don't wanna do it on these inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 257.34,
          "end": 261.03,
          "en": "because these check boxes are indeed optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.03,
          "end": 264.48,
          "en": "So I won't add required here, but I will add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.48,
          "end": 268.683,
          "en": "on my terms of use checkbox here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.93,
          "end": 274.5,
          "en": "And with that all done, now if I submit this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 274.5,
          "end": 279.3,
          "en": "I get an error message for every input that's invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 279.3,
          "end": 281.55,
          "en": "So I also get it for the password now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.55,
          "end": 283.38,
          "en": "and if I enter a too short password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.38,
          "end": 287.28,
          "en": "I also get an error regarding this, as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 292.28,
          "en": "And therefore, with that, we are forced to enter values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "in all these input fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 297.783,
          "en": "or we get an error message otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}